				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Madonna</strong> attended a preview of <strong>Holler If Ya Hear Me</strong> &#8211; a musical inspired by <strong>Tupac Shakur</strong>&#8216;s music &#8211; at the Palace Theatre in New York City yesterday to celebrate his birthday.</p>
<p><strong>Madonna</strong> sat in the third row, according to the Associated Press. <strong>2pac&#8217;s</strong> mother also attended the preview of the play.</p>
<p><strong>Tupac musical</strong> official open today and tell an original story about two young men dealing with life in an industrial city. The rapper died in 1996 at age 25.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
