				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Rumours were that <strong>Madonna</strong> was going to perform at the <strong>Amnesty International Bringing Human Rights Home concert</strong> at the Barclays Center in New York City on February 5th.</p>
<p>Rumours were not so unreliable, since <strong>Madonna</strong> has just announced that she will attend the <strong>Human Rights</strong> concert to introduce the <strong>Pussy Riot</strong>’s performance.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>Get ready to rock Brooklyn!</p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Madonna</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<p><a href="https://www.facebook.com/drownedmadonna/posts/10151832938625951" target="_blank">Click here</a> to watch the poster of the concert.</p>
<p>Besides the <strong>Pussy Riot</strong>, other big artists will perform: Blondie, Yoko Ono, Imagine Dragons, The Flaming Lips and Bob Geldolf.</p>
